ions%20granted%20by%20this%20License.%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%5C%22Source%5C%22%20form%20shall%20mean%20the%20preferred%20form%20for%20making%20modifications%2C%5Cn%20%20%20including%20but%20not%20limited%20to%20software%20source%20code%2C%20documentation%5Cn%20%20%20source%2C%20and%20configuration%20files.%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%5C%22Object%5C%22%20form%20shall%20mean%20any%20form%20resulting%20from%20mechanical%5Cn%20%20%20transformation%20or%20translation%20of%20a%20Source%20form%2C%20including%20but%5Cn%20%20%20not%20limited%20to%20compiled%20object%20code%2C%20generated%20documentation%2C%5Cn%20%20%20and%20conversions%20to%20other%20media%20types.%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%5C%22Work%5C%22%20shall%20mean%20the%20work%20of%20authorship%2C%20whether%20in%20Source%20or%5Cn%20%20%20Object%20form%2C%20made%20available%20under%20the%20License%2C%20as%20indicated%20by%20a%5Cn%20%20%20copyright%20notice%20that%20is%20included%20in%20or%20attached%20to%20the%20work%5Cn%20%20%20%28an%20example%20is%20provided%20in%20the%20Appendix%20below%29.%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%5C%22Derivative%20Works%5C%22%20shall%20mean%20any%20work%2C%20whether%20in%20Source%20or%20Object%5Cn%20%20%20form%2C%20that%20is%20based%20on%20%28or%20derived%20from%29%20the%20Work%20and%20for%20which%20the%5Cn%20%20%20editorial%20revisions%2C%20annotations%2C%20elaborations%2C%20or%20other%20modifications%5Cn%20%20%20represent%2C%20as%20a%20whole%2C%20an%20original%20work%20of%20authorship.%20For%20the%20purposes%5Cn%20%20%20of%20this%20License%2C%20Derivative%20Works%20shall%20not%20include%20works%20that%20remain%5Cn%20%20%20separable%20from%2C%20or%20merely%20link%20%28or%20bind%20by%20name%29%20to%20the%20interfaces%20of%2C%5Cn%20%20%20the%20Work%20and%20Derivative%20Works%20thereof.%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%5C%22Contribution%5C%22%20shall%20mean%20any%20work%20of%20authorship%2C%20including%5Cn%20%20%20the%20original%20version%20of%20the%20Work%20and%20any%20modifications%20or%20additions%5Cn%20%20%20to%20that%20Work%20or%20Derivative%20Works%20thereof%2C%20that%20is%20intentionally%5Cn%20%20%20submitted%20to%20Licensor%20for%20inclusion%20in%20the%20Work%20by%20the%20copyright%20owner%5Cn%20%20%20or%20by%20an%20individual%20or%20Legal%20Entity%20authorized%20to%20submit%20on%20behalf%20of%5Cn%20%20%20the%20copyright%20owner.%20For%20the%20purposes%20of%20this%20definition%2C%20%5C%22submitted%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20means%20any%20form%20of%20electronic%2C%20verbal%2C%20or%20written%20communication%20sent%5Cn%20%20%20to%20the%20Licensor%20or%20its%20representatives%2C%20including%20but%20not%20limited%20to%5Cn%20%20%20communication%20on%20electronic%20mailing%20lists%2C%20source%20code%20control%20systems%2C%5Cn%20%20%20and%20issue%20tracking%20systems%20that%20are%20managed%20by%2C%20or%20on%20behalf%20of%2C%20the%5Cn%20%20%20Licensor%20for%20the%20purpose%20of%20discussing%20and%20improving%20the%20Work%2C%20but%5Cn%20%20%20excluding%20communication%20that%20is%20conspicuously%20marked%20or%20otherwise%5Cn%20%20%20designated%20in%20writing%20by%20the%20copyright%20owner%20as%20%5C%22Not%20a%20Contribution.%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%5C%22Contributor%5C%22%20shall%20mean%20Licensor%20and%20any%20individual%20or%20Legal%20Entity%5Cn%20%20%20on%20behalf%20of%20whom%20a%20Contribution%20has%20been%20received%20by%20Licensor%20and%5Cn%20%20%20subsequently%20incorporated%20within%20the%20Work.%5Cn%5Cn2.%20Grant%20of%20Copyright%20License.%20Subject%20to%20the%20terms%20and%20conditions%20of%5Cn%20%20%20this%20License%2C%20each%20Contributor%20hereby%20grants%20to%20You%20a%20perpetual%2C%5Cn%20%20%20worldwide%2C%20non-exclusive%2C%20no-charge%2C%20royalty-free%2C%20irrevocable%5Cn%20%20%20copyright%20license%20to%20reproduce%2C%20prepare%20Derivative%20Works%20of%2C%5Cn%20%20%20publicly%20display%2C%20publicly%20perform%2C%20sublicense%2C%20and%20distribute%20the%5Cn%20%20%20Work%20and%20such%20Derivative%20Works%20in%20Source%20or%20Object%20form.%5Cn%5Cn3.%20Grant%20of%20Patent%20License.%20Subject%20to%20the%20terms%20and%20conditions%20of%5Cn%20%20%20this%20License%2C%20each%20Contributor%20hereby%20grants%20to%20You%20a%20perpetual%2C%5Cn%20%20%20worldwide%2C%20non-exclusive%2C%20no-charge%2C%20royalty-free%2C%20irrevocable%5Cn%20%20%20%28except%20as%20stated%20in%20this%20section%29%20patent%20license%20to%20make%2C%20have%20made%2C%5Cn%20%20%20use%2C%20offer%20to%20sell%2C%20sell%2C%20import%2C%20and%20otherwise%20transfer%20the%20Work%2C%5Cn%20%20%20where%20such%20license%20applies%20only%20to%20those%20patent%20claims%20licensable%5Cn%20%20%20by%20such%20Contributor%20that%20are%20necessarily%20infringed%20by%20their%5Cn%20%20%20Contribution%28s%29%20alone%20or%20by%20combination%20of%20their%20Contribution%28s%29%5Cn%20%20%20with%20the%20Work%20to%20which%20such%20Contribution%28s%29%20was%20submitted.%20If%20You%5Cn%20%20%20institute%20patent%20litigation%20against%20any%20entity%20%28including%20a%5Cn%20%20%20cross-claim%20or%20counterclaim%20in%20a%20lawsuit%29%20alleging%20that%20the%20Work%5Cn%20%20%20or%20a%20Contribution%20incorporated%20within%20the%20Work%20constitutes%20direct%5Cn%20%20%20or%20contributory%20patent%20infringement%2C%20then%20any%20patent%20licenses%5Cn%20%20%20granted%20to%20You%20under%20this%20License%20for%20that%20Work%20shall%20terminate%5Cn%20%20%20as%20of%20the%20date%20such%20litigation%20is%20filed.%5Cn%5Cn4.%20Redistribution.%20You%20may%20reproduce%20and%20distribute%20copies%20of%20the%5Cn%20%20%20Work%20or%20Derivative%20Works%20thereof%20in%20any%20medium%2C%20with%20or%20without%5Cn%20%20%20modifications%2C%20and%20in%20Source%20or%20Object%20form%2C%20provided%20that%20You%5Cn%20%20%20meet%20the%20following%20conditions%3A%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%28a%29%20You%20must%20give%20any%20other%20recipients%20of%20the%20Work%20or%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Derivative%20Works%20a%20copy%20of%20this%20License%3B%20and%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%28b%29%20You%20must%20cause%20any%20modified%20files%20to%20carry%20prominent%20notices%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20stating%20that%20You%20changed%20the%20files%3B%20and%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%28c%29%20You%20must%20retain%2C%20in%20the%20Source%20form%20of%20any%20Derivative%20Works%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20that%20You%20distribute%2C%20all%20copyright%2C%20patent%2C%20trademark%2C%20and%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20attribution%20notices%20from%20the%20Source%20form%20of%20the%20Work%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20excluding%20those%20notices%20that%20do%20not%20pertain%20to%20any%20part%20of%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20the%20Derivative%20Works%3B%20and%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%28d%29%20If%20the%20Work%20includes%20a%20%5C%22NOTICE%5C%22%20text%20file%20as%20part%20of%20its%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20distribution%2C%20then%20any%20Derivative%20Works%20that%20You%20distribute%20must%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20include%20a%20readable%20copy%20of%20the%20attribution%20notices%20contained%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20within%20such%20NOTICE%20file%2C%20excluding%20those%20notices%20that%20do%20not%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20pertain%20to%20any%20part%20of%20the%20Derivative%20Works%2C%20in%20at%20least%20one%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20of%20the%20following%20places%3A%20within%20a%20NOTICE%20text%20file%20distributed%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20as%20part%20of%20the%20Derivative%20Works%3B%20within%20the%20Source%20form%20or%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20documentation%2C%20if%20provided%20along%20with%20the%20Derivative%20Works%3B%20or%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20within%20a%20display%20generated%20by%20the%20Derivative%20Works%2C%20if%20and%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20wherever%20such%20third-party%20notices%20normally%20appear.%20The%20contents%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20of%20the%20NOTICE%20file%20are%20for%20informational%20purposes%20only%20and%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20do%20not%20modify%20the%20License.%20You%20may%20add%20Your%20own%20attribution%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20notices%20within%20Derivative%20Works%20that%20You%20distribute%2C%20alongside%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20or%20as%20an%20addendum%20to%20the%20NOTICE%20text%20from%20the%20Work%2C%20provided%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20that%20such%20additional%20attribution%20notices%20cannot%20be%20construed%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20as%20modifying%20the%20License.%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20You%20may%20add%20Your%20own%20copyright%20statement%20to%20Your%20modifications%20and%5Cn%20%20%20may%20provide%20additional%20or%20different%20license%20terms%20and%20conditions%5Cn%20%20%20for%20use%2C%20reproduction%2C%20or%20distribution%20of%20Your%20modifications%2C%20or%5Cn%20%20%20for%20any%20such%20Derivative%20Works%20as%20a%20whole%2C%20provided%20Your%20use%2C%5Cn%20%20%20reproduction%2C%20and%20distribution%20of%20the%20Work%20otherwise%20complies%20with%5Cn%20%20%20the%20conditions%20stated%20in%20this%20License.%5Cn%5Cn5.%20Submission%20of%20Contributions.%20Unless%20You%20explicitly%20state%20otherwise%2C%5Cn%20%20%20any%20Contribution%20intentionally%20submitted%20for%20inclusion%20in%20the%20Work%5Cn%20%20%20by%20You%20to%20the%20Licensor%20shall%20be%20under%20the%20terms%20and%20conditions%20of%5Cn%20%20%20this%20License%2C%20without%20any%20additional%20terms%20or%20conditions.%5Cn%20%20%20Notwithstanding%20the%20above%2C%20nothing%20herein%20shall%20supersede%20or%20modify%5Cn%20%20%20the%20terms%20of%20any%20separate%20license%20agreement%20you%20may%20have%20executed%5Cn%20%20%20with%20Licensor%20regarding%20such%20Contributions.%5Cn%5Cn6.%20Trademarks.%20This%20License%20does%20not%20grant%20permission%20to%20use%20the%20trade%5Cn%20%20%20names%2C%20trademarks%2C%20service%20marks%2C%20or%20product%20names%20of%20the%20Licensor%2C%5Cn%20%20%20except%20as%20required%20for%20reasonable%20and%20customary%20use%20in%20describing%20the%5Cn%20%20%20origin%20of%20the%20Work%20and%20reproducing%20the%20content%20of%20the%20NOTICE%20file.%5Cn%5Cn7.%20Disclaimer%20of%20Warranty.%20Unless%20required%20by%20applicable%20law%20or%5Cn%20%20%20agreed%20to%20in%20writing%2C%20Licensor%20provides%20the%20Work%20%28and%20each%5Cn%20%20%20Contributor%20provides%20its%20Contributions%29%20on%20an%20%5C%22AS%20IS%5C%22%20BASIS%2C%5Cn%20%20%20WITHOUT%20WARRANTIES%20OR%20CONDITIONS%20OF%20ANY%20KIND%2C%20either%20express%20or%5Cn%20%20%20implied%2C%20including%2C%20without%20limitation%2C%20any%20warranties%20or%20conditions%5Cn%20%20%20of%20TITLE%2C%20NON-INFRINGEMENT%2C%20MERCHANTABILITY%2C%20or%20FITNESS%20FOR%20A%5Cn%20%20%20PARTICULAR%20PURPOSE.%20You%20are%20solely%20responsible%20for%20determining%20the%5Cn%20%20%20appropriateness%20of%20using%20or%20redistributing%20the%20Work%20and%20assume%20any%5Cn%20%20%20risks%20associated%20with%20Your%20exercise%20of%20permissions%20under%20this%20License.%5Cn%5Cn8.%20Limitation%20of%20Liability.%20In%20no%20event%20and%20under%20no%20legal%20theory%2C%5Cn%20%20%20whether%20in%20tort%20%28including%20negligence%29%2C%20contract%2C%20or%20otherwise%2C%5Cn%20%20%20unless%20required%20by%20applicable%20law%20%28such%20as%20deliberate%20and%20grossly%5Cn%20%20%20negligent%20acts%29%20or%20agreed%20to%20in%20writing%2C%20shall%20any%20Contributor%20be%5Cn%20%20%20liable%20to%20You%20for%20damages%2C%20including%20any%20direct%2C%20indirect%2C%20special%2C%5Cn%20%20%20incidental%2C%20or%20consequential%20damages%20of%20any%20character%20arising%20as%20a%5Cn%20%20%20result%20of%20this%20License%20or%20out%20of%20the%20use%20or%20inability%20to%20use%20the%5Cn%20%20%20Work%20%28including%20but%20not%20limited%20to%20damages%20for%20loss%20of%20goodwill%2C%5Cn%20%20%20work%20stoppage%2C%20computer%20failure%20or%20malfunction%2C%20or%20any%20and%20all%5Cn%20%20%20other%20commercial%20damages%20or%20losses%29%2C%20even%20if%20such%20Contributor%5Cn%20%20%20has%20been%20advised%20of%20the%20possibility%20of%20such%20damages.%5Cn%5Cn9.%20Accepting%20Warranty%20or%20Additional%20Liability.%20While%20redistributing%5Cn%20%20%20the%20Work%20or%20Derivative%20Works%20thereof%2C%20You%20may%20choose%20to%20offer%2C%5Cn%20%20%20and%20charge%20a%20fee%20for%2C%20acceptance%20of%20support%2C%20warranty%2C%20indemnity