0%5B%5D%3B%5Cn%20%20let%20end%20=%200%3B%5Cn%20%20for%20%28const%20%5Bstart%2C%20stop%2C%20replacement%5D%20of%20replacements%29%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20pieces.push%28source.slice%28end%2C%20start%29%2C%20replacement%29%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20end%20=%20stop%3B%5Cn%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20const%20masked%20=%20replacements.length%20%3F%20pieces.join%28%27%27%29%20+%20source.slice%28end%29%20%3A%20source%3B%5Cn%20%20return%20lex%28masked%2C%20%27Rust%27%29.map%28token%20=>%20%28%7B%20...token%2C%20text%3A%20source.slice%28token.start%2C%20token.end%29%20%7D%29%29%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnexport%20function%20sourceItems%28source%29%20%7B%5Cn%20%20const%20tokens%20=%20rustTokens%28source%29%3B%5Cn%20%20return%20topLevelRustItems%28tokens%29.map%28item%20=>%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20const%20significant%20=%20item.tokens.filter%28token%20=>%20token.type%20!==%20%27comment%27%29%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20let%20keyword%20=%20significant.find%28token%20=>%20%5B%27fn%27%2C%20%27struct%27%2C%20%27union%27%2C%20%27enum%27%2C%20%27impl%27%2C%20%27trait%27%2C%20%27mod%27%2C%20%27use%27%2C%20%27const%27%2C%20%27static%27%2C%20%27type%27%2C%20%27macro%27%2C%20%27macro_rules!%27%5D.includes%28token.text%29%29%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20%28keyword%3F.text%20===%20%27const%27%20&&%20significant%5Bsignificant.indexOf%28keyword%29%20+%201%5D%3F.text%20===%20%27fn%27%29%20keyword%20=%20significant%5Bsignificant.indexOf%28keyword%29%20+%201%5D%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20const%20index%20=%20significant.indexOf%28keyword%29%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20%7B%20...item%2C%20term%3A%20item.comment%20%3F%20%27comment%27%20%3A%20keyword%3F.text%20%3F%3F%20%27opaque%27%2C%20name%3A%20keyword%20%3F%20significant%5Bindex%20+%201%5D%3F.text%20%3F%3F%20null%20%3A%20null%20%7D%3B%5Cn%20%20%7D%29%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%22%7D%2C%7B%22path%22%3A%22tools/translation/js-to-rust/generated/owned-core-witness/runtime/time-NOTICE.md%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22These%20generic%20pure%20time%20adapters%20use%20the%20semantic%20contracts%20of%20Rust%201.89.0%20%60std%3A%3Atime%3A%3ADuration%60%2C%20implemented%20in%20the%20official%20%5Bcore/time.rs%5D%28https%3A//github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/1.89.0/library/core/src/time.rs%29.%20Rust%20is%20licensed%20under%20MIT%20or%20Apache-2.0.%20This%20repository%20implements%20the%20contracts%20independently%3B%20it%20does%20not%20replace%20individual%20Router%20Rust%20functions%20with%20handwritten%20JavaScript.%5Cn%5CnThe%20downloaded%20source%20SHA256%2C%20byte%20count%2C%20function%20const%20markers%20and%20Router%20lexical%20usage%20inventory%20are%20recorded%20in%20%60../fixtures/time-contract-provenance.json%60.%20The%20source%20was%20inspected%20without%20running%20Rust.%20The%20algebraic%20record%20is%20a%20lowering%20representation%20of%20exact%20u64%20seconds%20and%20normalized%20u32%20nanoseconds%2C%20not%20a%20claim%20about%20physical%20Rust%20memory%20layout%20or%20permission%20to%20access%20private%20Rust%20fields.%5Cn%5CnDuration%20%60min%60/%60max%60%20use%20the%20pinned%20%5Bcore/cmp.rs%5D%28https%3A//github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/1.89.0/library/core/src/cmp.rs%29%20default%20%60Ord%60%20methods%20and%20the%20derived%20seconds-then-nanoseconds%20ordering.%20Equal%20operands%20select%20the%20first%20operand%20for%20%60min%60%20and%20the%20second%20for%20%60max%60%2C%20retaining%20the%20checked%20immutable%20Copy%20operand.%20Both%20methods%20are%20pure%20and%20non-const%20in%20the%20pinned%20profile.%5Cn%5Cn%60time-contracts.mjs%60%20registers%20stable%20pure%20method/type%20signatures%2C%20immutable%20Option/Result%20layouts%2C%20explicit%20%60pure%3A%20true%60%20and%20source-grounded%20%60constEligible%60%20metadata.%20Trait%20arithmetic%2C%20comparisons%2C%20%60Default%60%2C%20floating%20constructors%20and%20float-error%20string%20conversion%20are%20pure%20but%20not%20const%20in%20this%20pinned%20profile.%20ZERO/MAX%20constants%20are%20registered%20separately.%20The%20registry%20must%20preserve%20these%20distinctions%20instead%20of%20treating%20deterministic%20host%20calls%20as%20automatically%20const%20or%20allowing%20arbitrary%20source-private%20constructors.%5Cn%5Cn%60time-runtime.mjs%60%20uses%20BigInt%20for%20fixed%20integers%2C%20throws%20on%20malformed%20checked%20values%20or%20source%20panic%20paths%2C%20and%20returns%20real%20typed%20Option/Result%20outcomes.%20Floating%20construction%20decodes%20the%20original%20IEEE-754%20binary64%20rational%20and%20rounds%20to%20nanoseconds%20with%20ties%20to%20even%3B%20it%20does%20not%20multiply%20a%20rounded%20JavaScript%20Number%20by%20a%20billion%20first.%20There%20is%20no%20clock%2C%20timer%2C%20filesystem%2C%20network%20or%20environment%20capability%20in%20the%20runtime.%5Cn%5CnIndependent%20fixtures%20exercise%20the%20semantic%20checker%20layouts%2C%20u64/u32/u128%20boundaries%2C%20borrow/carry%2C%20underflow%2C%20division%20remainder%2C%20saturation%2C%20source%20panic%20distinctions%2C%20immutable%20owner%20fields%2C%20binary64%20ties%2C%20nanosecond%20carry%2C%20finite-domain%20errors%20and%20const%20metadata.%20These%20prove%20the%20adapter%20subset%20in%20Node/Bun%2C%20not%20whole%20Router%20execution.%20The%20frontend%20registry%20and%20generated-code%20integration%20are%20separate%20obligations.%20f32%2C%20unstable%20unit%20constructors%2C%20clocks%2C%20sleep%2C%20chrono%2C%20debug%20formatting%2C%20iterator%20Sum%20and%20assignment/borrow%20semantics%20remain%20explicit%20limitations.%5Cn%22%7D%2C%7B%22path%22%3A%22src/lib.rs%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22pub%20mod%20translation_core%3B%5Cn%22%7D%2C%7B%22path%22%3A%22src/translation_core.rs%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22//!%20Owned%20compatibility%20operations%20shared%20by%20Rust%20and%20checked%20translation.%5Cn//!%5Cn//!%20These%20library%20implementations%20are%20intentionally%20not%20translated.%20The%5Cn//!%20translator%20binds%20this%20complete%20facade%20and%20checks%20its%20supported%20operand%20domain.%5Cn%5Cnmod%20primitives%3B%5Cnpub%20use%20self%3A%3Aprimitives%3A%3A%7BJson%2C%20Maybe%2C%20Outcome%2C%20Str%7D%3B%5Cnpub%20use%20self%3A%3Aprimitives%3A%3Aunicode_scalar_count%3B%5Cnpub%20use%20self%3A%3Aprimitives%3A%3A%7Bjson_copy%2C%20json_with_field%7D%3B%5Cnpub%20use%20self%3A%3Aprimitives%3A%3A%7Bjson_parse%2C%20json_parse_bytes%7D%3B%5Cnpub%20use%20self%3A%3Aprimitives%3A%3A%7Bjson_index_str%2C%20json_index_usize%2C%20json_map_index%7D%3B%5Cn%5Cnmod%20json_collections%3B%5Cnpub%20use%20self%3A%3Ajson_collections%3A%3A%7Bjson_map%2C%20json_filter_map%7D%3B%5Cn%5Cnmod%20ranges%3B%5Cnpub%20use%20self%3A%3Aranges%3A%3Af64_inclusive_contains%3B%5Cn%5Cn///%20Owned%20UTF-8%20text%20returned%20by%20the%20compatibility%20formatting%20operation.%5Cnpub%20type%20Text%20=%20%3A%3Astd%3A%3Astring%3A%3AString%3B%5Cn%5Cn%23%5Bdoc%28hidden%29%5D%5Cn%23%5Bmacro_export%5D%5Cnmacro_rules!%20__router_translation_core_format%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%28%24%28%24arguments%3Att%29*%29%20=>%20%7B%20%3A%3Astd%3A%3Aformat!%28%24%28%24arguments%29*%29%20%7D%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn///%20Format%20through%20Rust%27s%20library%3B%20translation%20checks%20the%20primitive%20format%20subset.%5Cnpub%20use%20crate%3A%3A__router_translation_core_format%20as%20format%3B%5Cn%5Cn%23%5Bdoc%28hidden%29%5D%5Cn%23%5Bmacro_export%5D%5Cnmacro_rules!%20__router_translation_core_json%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%28%24%28%24tokens%3Att%29*%29%20=>%20%7B%20%3A%3Aserde_json%3A%3Ajson!%28%24%28%24tokens%29*%29%20%7D%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn///%20Construct%20JSON%20through%20the%20library%3B%20translation%20checks%20each%20supported%20value.%5Cnpub%20use%20crate%3A%3A__router_translation_core_json%20as%20json%3B%5Cn%22%7D%2C%7B%22path%22%3A%22src/translation_core/primitives.rs%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22//!%20Primitive%20types%20in%20the%20owned%20Rust/JavaScript%20compatibility%20interface.%5Cn%5Cn///%20A%20borrowed%20UTF-8%20string%20slice%2C%20with%20ordinary%20Rust%20reference%20lifetimes.%5Cn///%5Cn///%20The%20alias%20allocates%20no%20storage%20and%20does%20not%20transfer%20ownership.%20The%20checked%5Cn///%20translation%20binds%20qualified%20references%20to%20its%20existing%20borrowed-text%20domain%3B%5Cn///%20it%20does%20not%20translate%20the%20standard%20library%20implementation%20of%20%60str%60.%5Cnpub%20type%20Str%20=%20%3A%3Astd%3A%3Aprimitive%3A%3Astr%3B%5Cn%5Cn///%20JSON%20values%20use%20the%20registered%20immutable%20checked%20representation%20in%20translation.%5Cn///%20The%20serde_json%20implementation%20remains%20an%20untranslated%20native%20dependency.%5Cnpub%20type%20Json%20=%20%3A%3Aserde_json%3A%3AValue%3B%5Cn%5Cn///%20Optional%20values%20retain%20Rust%27s%20ordinary%20variant%2C%20borrowing%20and%20Drop%20behavior.%5Cnpub%20type%20Maybe<T>%20=%20%3A%3Astd%3A%3Aoption%3A%3AOption<T>%3B%5Cn%5Cn///%20Success%20and%20failure%20values%20retain%20both%20payloads%20and%20their%20ownership%20behavior.%5Cnpub%20type%20Outcome<T%2C%20E>%20=%20%3A%3Astd%3A%3Aresult%3A%3AResult<T%2C%20E>%3B%5Cn%5Cn///%20Count%20Unicode%20scalar%20values%2C%20not%20UTF-8%20bytes%2C%20UTF-16%20units%20or%20graphemes.%5Cn///%20The%20library%20iterator%20implementation%20remains%20intentionally%20untranslated.%5Cn%23%5Bmust_use%5D%5Cnpub%20fn%20unicode_scalar_count%28value%3A%20&Str%29%20->%20usize%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20value.chars%28%29.count%28%29%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn///%20Copy%20one%20canonical%20JSON%20value%20without%20sharing%20mutable%20storage.%5Cn///%20Translation%20uses%20a%20bounded%20immutable%20deep%20copy%20%284096%20nodes%2C%20depth%2032%29.%5Cn%23%5Bmust_use%5D%5Cnpub%20fn%20json_copy%28value%3A%20&Json%29%20->%20Json%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3A%3Astd%3A%3Aclone%3A%3AClone%3A%3Aclone%28value%29%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn///%20Set%20a%20string%20key%20on%20an%20owned%20object%20%28or%20promote%20Null%20to%20an%20object%29.%5Cn///%20Non-object%2C%20non-null%20bases%20panic%2C%20matching%20serde_json%20string%20indexing.%5Cn///%20Arguments%20evaluate%20once%2C%20left%20to%20right.%20Allocation/Drop%20internals%20remain%5Cn///%20untranslated%3B%20translation%20admits%20bounded%20successful-resource%20projections.%5Cn%23%5Bmust_use%5D%5Cnpub%20fn%20json_with_field%28mut%20base%3A%20Json%2C%20key%3A%20&Str%2C%20value%3A%20Json%29%20->%20Json%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20base%5Bkey%5D%20=%20value%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20base%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn///%20Read%20a%20string%20key%3B%20absent%20keys%20and%20non-object%20values%20return%20JSON%20Null.%5Cn///%20The%20returned%20reference%20borrows%20only%20%60value%60%2C%20never%20the%20key.%5Cn%23%5Bmust_use%5D%5Cnpub%20fn%20json_index_str<%27a>%28value%3A%20&%27a%20Json%2C%20key%3A%20&Str%29%20->%20&%27a%20Json%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20&value%5Bkey%5D%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn///%20Read%20an%20array%20position%3B%20absent%20positions%20and%20non-arrays%20return%20JSON%20Null.%5Cn///%20The%20returned%20reference%20borrows%20only%20%60value%60.%5Cn%23%5Bmust_use%5D%5Cnpub%20fn%20json_index_usize<%27a>%28value%3A%20&%27a%20Json%2C%20index%3A%20usize%29%20->%20&%27a%20Json%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20&value%5Bindex%5D%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn///%20Read%20an%20existing%20map%20entry%2C%20panicking%20when%20the%20key%20is%20absent.%5Cn///%20This%20differs%20from%20Value%20indexing%20and%20never%20inserts%20an%20entry.%5Cn%23%5Bmust_use%5D%5Cnpub%20fn%20json_map_index<%27a>%28%5Cn%20%20%20%20value%3A%20&%27a%20%3A%3Aserde_json%3A%3AMap<%3A%3Astd%3A%3Astring%3A%3AString%2C%20Json>%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20key%3A%20&Str%2C%5Cn%29%20->%20&%27a%20Json%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20&value%5Bkey%5D%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn///%20Decode%20canonical%20JSON%20text%2C%20discarding%20only%20the%20native%20parser%27s%20error%20value.%5Cn///%20Successful%20JSON%20null%20is%20%60Some%28Json%3A%3ANull%29%60%2C%20distinct%20from%20invalid%20JSON.%5Cn///%20The%20checked%20translation%20uses%20its%20bounded%2C%20source-selected%20roundtrip%20adapter%3B%5Cn///%20native%20serde_json%20allocation%2C%20parser%20and%20error%20Drop%20internals%20stay%20untranslated.%5Cn%23%5Bmust_use%5D%5Cnpub%20fn%20json_parse%28value%3A%20&Str%29%20->%20Maybe<Json>%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3A%3Aserde_json%3A%3Afrom_str%3A%3A<Json>%28value%29.ok%28%29%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cn///%20Decode%20canonical%20JSON%20bytes%20with%20the%20same%20optional%20success%20boundary.%5Cn///%20Invalid%20JSON%20or%20UTF-8%20returns%20None%3B%20translation%20adapter-domain%20errors%20throw.%5Cn%23%5Bmust_use%5D%5Cnpub%20fn%20json_parse_bytes%28value%3A%20&%5Bu8%5D%29%20->%20Maybe<Json>%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3A%3Aserde_json%3A%3Afrom_slice%3A%3A<Json>%28value%29.ok%28%29%5Cn%7D%5Cn%22%7D%2C%7B%22path%22%3A%22Cargo.toml%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22%5Bpackage%5D%5Cnname%20=%20%5C%22link-assistant-router%5C%22%5Cnversion%20=%20%5C%221.24.1%5C%22%5Cnedition%20=%20%5C%222024%5C%22%5Cndescription%20=%20%5C%22Link.Assistant.Router%20%E2%80%94%20Claude%20MAX%20OAuth%20proxy%20and%20token%20gateway%20for%20Anthropic%20APIs%5C%22%5Cnreadme%20=%20%5C%22README.md%5C%22%5Cnlicense%20=%20%5C%22Unlicense%5C%22%5Cnkeywords%20=%20%5B%5C%22proxy%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22anthropic%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22claude%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22gateway%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22oauth%5C%22%5D%5Cncategories%20=%20%5B%5C%22web-programming%3A%3Ahttp-server%5C%22%5D%5Cnrepository%20=%20%5C%22https%3A//github.com/link-assistant/router%5C%22%5Cndocumentation%20=%20%5C%22https%3A//docs.rs/link-assistant-router%5C%22%5Cnrust-version%20=%20%5C%221.89%5C%22%5Cnexclude%20=%20%5B%5C%22dev/log/**%5C%22%5D%5Cn%5Cn%5Blib%5D%5Cnname%20=%20%5C%22link_assistant_router%5C%22%5Cnpath%20=%20%5C%22src/lib.rs%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%23%20The%20canonical%20command%20is%20%60router%60%3A%20the%20name%20the%20project%2C%20its%20repository%20and%5Cn%23%20its%20documentation%20already%20use%20for%20itself%20%28issue%20%23222%29.%20The%20original%20name%20is%5Cn%23%20kept%20as%20a%20second%20binary%20from%20the%20same%20source%20so%20existing%20scripts%2C%20deployments%5Cn%23%20and%20documented%20commands%20keep%20working.%20That%20target%20has%20its%20own%20file%2C%20which%5Cn%23%20%60include!%60s%20%60src/main.rs%60%3A%20Cargo%20warns%20on%20every%20build%20when%20two%20targets%20name%5Cn%23%20the%20same%20file%20%28issue%20%23648%29.%5Cn%5B%5Bbin%5D%5D%5Cnname%20=%20%5C%22router%5C%2